ion and Dietetics Practitioners?#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#ChatGPT and Future Artificial Intelligence Chatbots: What may be the Influence on Credentialed Nutrition and Dietetics Practitioners?#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[39,40],"#ChatGPT and Future Artificial Intelligence Chatbots: What may be the Influence on Credentialed Nutrition and Dietetics Practitioners?#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#ChatGPT and Future Artificial Intelligence Chatbots: What may be the Influence on Credentialed Nutrition and Dietetics Practitioners?#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/K4W8UFV8","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LREN8TF?page=1&annotation=9JWXHZ3A","line":30},{"title":"Sayfa 3","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LREN8TF?page=3&annotation=F5SJF2UR","line":30},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LREN8TF?page=5&annotation=YIS276FA","line":39},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LREN8TF?page=5&annotation=BMA7J8GQ","line":42},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/9LREN8TF?page=5&annotation=E8W4B4T2","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"ChatGPT and Future Artificial Intelligence Chatbots: What may be the Influence on Credentialed Nutrition and Dietetics Practitioners?","Authors":"Angeline Chatelan, Aurélien Clerc, Pierre-Alexandre Fonta","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.1016/j.jand.2023.08.001","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"","Findings":"","Conclusions":"AI chatbots can assist RDNs and NDTRs, but cannot be used as a replacement for their expertise, judgment, and soft skills. We should be aware of this technology and promote our profession and our competencies over ChatGPT to the general public, communities, and patients/clients. In parallel, we should reinforce our profession to provide high-quality, accurate, and tailored nutrition counseling and care and show empathy, attentiveness, and ability to motivate communities and patients/ clients. This can be achieved notably with high-performance training programs and continuing education.","Limitations":"Missing opportunities for in-person contact and care because patients/clients rely only on artificial intelligence-generated advice   Facilitating academic dishonestReferring to uncertified nutrition professionals if unaware of the difference between them and RDNs and NDTRs, when ChatGPT warns about consulting a RDNs and NDTRs","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"7a8rxp","at":1774939655366}},"smart_blocks:chatelanChatGPTFutureArtificial2023c.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.001156,0.03385242,0.00797616,0.00527978,-0.01028036,0.02327655,0.01882702,0.07806487,-0.02528542,-0.0317383,-0.01074198,-0.09163693,0.01803085,0.05505817,0.07936855,-0.01329327,0.02706704,-0.00170963,-0.00028169,0.04356285,0.05107695,-0.04088305,0.01926698,0.00513215,0.00191204,0.00747752,-0.0372943,-0.08221567,-0.05959649,-0.17494643,0.02134942,-0.02224193,0.07246098,-0.01522316,-0.04376067,0.04766566,-0.01506324,0.02267475,-0.00617132,0.03868502,0.01451474,-0.04512125,0.02855493,-0.01218005,0.00899004,-0.00574306,-0.01559776,-0.01406699,-0.1083858,-0.04265672,-0.04442531,-0.03540972,0.05279233,0.03279502,0.0251238,0.0357339,0.05016744,0.0484942,0.05227659,0.08436677,-0.00782443,0.0667736,-0.21000843,0.09188018,0.02182288,0.07673819,-0.06797955,0.04575072,0.02692905,-0.02873401,-0.00810048,-0.01611902,0.01525665,0.02282372,0.04291409,0.01578979,0.021389,-0.03542881,0.04808866,0.01022761,0.00408491,0.04504303,-0.05676152,-0.00103893,-0.0414173,-0.03098279,0.0186847,-0.07349318,0.01301596,-0.01224556,-0.02871542,-0.02816483,0.01148288,0.02558469,-0.01894543,-0.02785821,-0.02503502,0.02382463,-0.08722543,0.09429759,-0.0